+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DBLW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Dark, flaggy quartzites, purple quartzose phyllites. White limestones. Calcareous flags and pebbly grits. (Correlative of Whitchells Group-Pelitic Group and Upper Psammitic Group)."@en .
